<font color="#ffffff">Morning.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">Are you here to see Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">Why is he zoning out over there?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:45,040
<font color="#ffffff">Okay. I'll just go and talk to him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">Here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">For me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, so we can keep in touch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:30,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's necessary to have a phone these days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:32,120
<font color="#ffffff">Save my number, and we can get in touch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong with you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,200
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so confused.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">Confused?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">About what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,840
<font color="#ffffff">Everything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">It makes no sense.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:24,960
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know how it will end.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">But that's no surprise.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,960
<font color="#ffffff">This is me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">I don't even know myself well enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:42,840
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">Go where?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Just come with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Get up.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

199
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Where?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,319
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,280
<font color="#ffffff">You can't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:32,800
<font color="#ffffff">Entering someone's home</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">without permission is trespassing.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

205
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:36,720
<font color="#ffffff">You're being a full-on cop now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">That's the law.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:41,560
<font color="#ffffff">You could even be charged</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with property damage and theft.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

208
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">Whose place is this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek's.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,080
<font color="#ffffff">Is this my house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">So what? Are you still arresting me now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,520
<font color="#ffffff">Who would arrest you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">You're a pro.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">Have you ever committed burglary?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">Are you coming in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,200
<font color="#ffffff">Whose place is this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Is this my house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't you want to learn more</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about yourself?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

221
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">This is the best way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">PRESENTED TO CHANSUEK</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">FOR EXEMPLARY PUBLIC SERVICE<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

223
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,400
<font color="#ffffff">You're right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:11,600
<font color="#ffffff">Being back at my own place</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">helped me remember who I truly am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">You seem to be a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,760
<font color="#ffffff">You've won a lot of awards.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:26,520
<font color="#ffffff">These things don't tell you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">whether someone is good or not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,640
<font color="#ffffff">At least I see your hard work.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are these…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">all yours?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:50,320
<font color="#ffffff">I wanted this one,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but couldn't find it anywhere.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

235
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:55,160
<font color="#ffffff">Do you collect action figures?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">What kind of woman collects them?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">A woman like me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I have become a…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:11,720
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I have become a photographer?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Photographer?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">How's that related?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah. It is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't you and everyone else</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">tell me not to come home?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

247
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">I was afraid you'd be in danger.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:42,560
<font color="#ffffff">I was afraid the people</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">coming after you would find you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

249
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,400
<font color="#ffffff">Is it safe now, then?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:49,520
<font color="#ffffff">Just take a quick look and leave.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Why would you stay for long?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

251
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">It feels quiet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,680
<font color="#ffffff">Did I live alone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">Wait…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">I have parents.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">Who in the world doesn't have parents?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">You think you were born from a bamboo?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:36,360
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't mean it that way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">I mean if I have parents,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">where are they now?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

260
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:43,920
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:46,280
<font color="#ffffff">From what I was told,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">they both passed away in an accident.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">Then…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">That means I'm alone in this world.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">Idiot. You're not alone.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You still have your grandma.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

266
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">She raised you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:30,120
<font color="#ffffff">And you love her so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">You have to visit her more often.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">Grandma?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">Grandma?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:48,000
<font color="#ffffff">Grandma…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">Grandma!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,320
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:22:58,400 --> 00:23:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">My head hurts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,960
<font color="#ffffff">Sit down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">Sit here and rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">How are you feeling?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:21,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:23,960
<font color="#ffffff">All of a sudden,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">I saw a flashback of Grandma.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:23:27,520 --> 00:23:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">So that means coming here…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">helped you remember something.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Familiar places and surroundings</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">seem to help.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

284
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:52,200
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:59,720
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon was your boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:01,680
<font color="#ffffff">I think you know that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:24:19,040 --> 00:24:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">You seem to admire Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:43,160
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Weird. I don't see it.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:41,280
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:25:42,360 --> 00:25:43,600
<font color="#ffffff">What are you looking for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:25:47,600 --> 00:25:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">I think we should go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:52,600
<font color="#ffffff">Wait! Hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:17,720
<font color="#ffffff">What the heck are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't know what you were looking for.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you tell me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,560
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:32,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:33,480
<font color="#ffffff">I was…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">I was just wondering why you don't have</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a photo with your girlfriend.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

303
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:43,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:26:53,560 --> 00:26:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">You're right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">I think you learned enough about yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,560
<font color="#ffffff">We should go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:27:13,920 --> 00:27:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder how my grandma is doing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:19,240
<font color="#ffffff">She's doing fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:27:19,320 --> 00:27:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">She's worried.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:27:22,520 --> 00:27:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:27:24,600 --> 00:27:25,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">I saw her before the trip to Mae Hong Son.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:31,840
<font color="#ffffff">Wait. Why did you see my grandma?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:27:34,360 --> 00:27:35,680
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:27:37,600 --> 00:27:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">I just ran into her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">That doesn't sound right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">You know where I live.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:49,600
<font color="#ffffff">You know my history.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:52,720
<font color="#ffffff">And you ran into my grandma.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:59,920
<font color="#ffffff">It feels like you were investigating me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,200
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">I saw your grandma by chance.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Your address and background.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:16,320
<font color="#ffffff">I found out about it in Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:22,120
<font color="#ffffff">I should not have helped you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,400
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">Wait a minute!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:34,720
<font color="#ffffff">Wait for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,520
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:38,440
<font color="#ffffff">Wait. Are you mad at me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not mad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:28:42,040 --> 00:28:43,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just annoyed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't trust me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">or if you suspect me…<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

339
00:28:47,080 --> 00:28:50,880
<font color="#ffffff">-I want nothing to do with you.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-No. I just… Okay, I'm sorry.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

340
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">I won't suspect you anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">That's good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">We should go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:09,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hey. Duck.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:01,560
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

346
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">I think we lost him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's man followed us here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:48,920
<font color="#ffffff">So he knew we fled to Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">That was quick.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:53,520
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:31:53,600 --> 00:31:55,520
